# --- Arduino / PlatformIO build output ---
# Nothing from a build directory is ever committed. Arduino writes the UF2
# to <sketch>/build/<fqbn>/<sketch>.ino.uf2; a rebuild wipes it.
# A released binary is copied to Firmware/<version>/<MODULE>.uf2 and
# committed from there — see Rule 7 in the workspace AGENTS.md.
**/build/
.pio/
*.hex
*.elf
*.map
*.d
*.o

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
